flowchart TD
    A([Start: Book Appointment]) --> B[Get patient phone number]
    B --> C{Patient already registered?}
    C -->|No| D[Register new patient]
    D --> E[Get preferred clinic and date]
    C -->|Yes| E
    E --> F{Slot available<br/>on that date?}
    F -->|Yes| G["Confirm booking, reduce open slots,<br/>send SMS confirmation"]
    F -->|No| H[Suggest next available date]
    G --> I([Log interaction and End])
    H --> I
